        "original_id": "f1292a05-9a4f-57eb-b3ff-d45d0d5fba98",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Luke Goss, David S. Goyer, Guillermo del Toro, Wesley Snipes\n- Films: Blade II, One Night with the King, Hellboy II: The Golden Army, Tekken, Interview with a Hitman\n- Roles: Jared Nomak, King Xerxes, Prince Nuada, Steve Fox, Viktor, Blade\n\nFacts:\n- In 2002, Luke Goss appeared in Blade II as Jared Nomak.\n- Blade II was written by David S. Goyer, who also wrote the previous film.\n- Blade II was directed by Guillermo del Toro.\n- Wesley Snipes returned in Blade II as the lead character Blade and as a producer.\n- In 2006, Luke Goss appeared in One Night with the King as King Xerxes.\n- In 2008, Luke Goss appeared in Hellboy II: The Golden Army as Prince Nuada.\n- In 2010, Luke Goss appeared in Tekken as Steve Fox.\n- In 2012, Luke Goss appeared in Interview with a Hitman as Viktor.",
